ord and see what's going on there.  I have to get going now, dear.  I'll talk to you soon and send you some email...hopefullywe'll catch each other on here someday.  Take care.Love,Christa**roxanne**To: aceSubj: hi loveDate: Aug  1i miss my hubby....it's getting cold and lonely between my sheets :)   *who said that?**smooch*me**roxanne**To: aceSubj: Where's my hubby?Date: May  7I guess you don't stay whenever you're here so there's slight chance of meeting you here :(.  I feel bad that I forgot your birthday...I know you hinted and I forgot...no dumb excuses....I'm sorry.  But since you forgot mine too we'll just have to make it up to each other.  ;)OK...talk to you soon :)Love, your adoring wife....Me**"
